65408392476.png/3uJAUvUOSkd_FFo2rcY8j9UI9MM0tfK2KDY72ig2O9o\"/><figcaption>曾獲米凱拉雷恩斯救助的動物（IG@saveafox_rescue）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾獲米凱拉雷恩斯救助的動物（IG@saveafox_rescue）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250717/1022588259735179264706415.png/3jxYEMqtMMUFwL2Rv5_jM9oqYgaqF6FbI6EPIyOhDyM\"/><figcaption>曾獲米凱拉雷恩斯救助的動物（IG@saveafox_rescue）</figcaption></figure><p>230元不想付！外籍男「猛拔胸毛」放入炒粿條　栽贓過程全被拍</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T03:40:48.676278+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1756,"images":29,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T03:30:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:58:00.614509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T03:37:54.972415+00:00","content_hash":"b38133ab71dfda985cbbe5d0532c540da172455d2bea76650d52cd6f2e118fde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}